            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"section-0-low-level-io\">Section 0: low-level I/O</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Read until we see the end of headers (<code>\\r\\n\\r\\n</code>). Write status/headers/</li>\n<li>body. Nothing higher-level here \u2014 just bytes on a socket.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
