            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"section-2-parsing\">Section 2: parsing</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>An HTTP request becomes a plain dict. Cookies are parsed once. Path</li>\n<li>Parameters are filled in by the route matcher (Section 3).</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
