            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"section-3-routing\">Section 3: routing</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Routes are a plain list of (method, regex_pattern, handler) tuples,</li>\n<li>built once by compile_routes(). Matching is a linear scan; for a chat</li>\n<li>app with ~10 routes that's negligible.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
